{
  "note": "Candidate pool for the hero-preset sweep. Fixed BEFORE any sweep data was collected and hashed into the pre-registration amendment. Audiences are described only from the three domains our own measurement found discriminate film taste sharply -- television (0.06), video games (0.08) and music (0.11) -- never brands, books, podcasts or places, which do not. Music is allowed only as a minority of an audience's entities. Each audience carries at least 6 entities because taste/pitch.py cannot cross-check a describing catalogue smaller than SPLIT_MIN=6 -- an audience of 4 returns no split-half agreement at all, so the quality gate could never be satisfied.",
